.SH "نام (NAME)"
PTtiffdump \- Compare two TIFF images
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBPTtiffdump\fR [options] \fItiff_file1\fR \fItiff_file2\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBPTtiffdump\fR compares the contents of 2 different tiff files. If the
byte is different, it gets output.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \fB\-o\fR 4
.IX Item "-o"
Overwrite output file if it exists.
.IP \fB\-q\fR 4
.IX Item "-q"
Quiet run
.IP \fB\-h\fR 4
.IX Item "-h"
Output help summary.
